ocking":0},"body":"### Which @angular/* package(s) are the source of the bug?\n\ncore\n\n### Is this a regression?\n\nNo\n\n### Description\n\nWe have the following code before the migration \r\n\r\n\r\n```html\r\n\r\n<ng-container\r\n    *ngIf=\"\r\n        check1&&\r\n        check2&& {\r\n            allowed: service.BehaviorSubject$ | async\r\n        } as viewData\r\n    \"\r\n>\r\n...\r\n</ng-container>\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nafter migration to the new control flow we get following error:\r\n\r\n`NG1: Object is possibly 'null'. [plugin angular-compiler]`\r\n\r\nwhen we try to access check1 or check2 with this code:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n@if (check1 && check2 &&\r\n        {\r\n            allowed: service.BehaviorSubject$ | async\r\n        };\r\n        as viewData ) {\r\n     ...\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nif we rewrite the code to this everything works as expected\r\n\r\n```html\r\n@if (check1 && check2) {\r\n    @if (\r\n        {\r\n            allowed: service.BehaviorSubject$ | async\r\n        };\r\n        as viewData ) {\r\n     }\r\n    ...\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\n\n### Please provide a link to a minimal reproduction of the bug\n\n_No response_\n\n### Please provide the exception or error you saw\n\n```true\n`NG1: Object is possibly 'null'. [plugin angular-compiler]`\n```\n\n\n### Please provide the environment you discovered this bug in (run `ng version`)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Anything else?\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"dylhunn","id":7135246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzUyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7135246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn","html_url":"https://github.com/dylhunn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap